From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 12:49:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 93/98] fix(cron): ended trials and the daily campaign jobs run
 between deploys (4295)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Plate NEW-4: two timers never ran. The subscription downgrade waited its
whole five hours before the first run, and the warm-tie questions, stale
sweep and delivery prune their whole day — and the server is deployed far
more often, so a restart always came first. Each now also runs once soon
after start (2 and 15 minutes); all are idempotent (the warm-tie cooldown
lives in its query), so a run of deploys asks nobody twice. Read today:
0 accounts are past their trial or period end.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
